=== (B) analytic Gram diagonalisation (all L); ranks at relative tolerance ===
gains of  l -> P^perp l P  are sqrt(den_ij/2), of  Z -> P^perp Z P  are sqrt(denc_ij/2);
max gain = 1/sqrt(2) = 0.7071.  rank(tau) := #{gains > tau * maxgain}.
